                                "sense_id": "6405a303-14b7-3539-b8b0-768df9f6b8e6",
                                "text": "It may have been delivered direct to the saucery by the wardrobe clerk, but this can not be proved, as the 'Black Book' lacks an independent 'sausery' section."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e776fa5f-f803-4949-88ba-fbc6518b02d5",
                                "sense_id": "6405a303-14b7-3539-b8b0-768df9f6b8e6",
                                "text": "Next door to the dry fish house, a staircase went up to the first floor to a landing which led left into the pastry and saucery office (no. 21) and right into the confectionary (no. 22)."
                            }
